tux.svg is Tux, the Linux penguin, as published on Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tux.svg

Original illustration by Larry Ewing (lewing@isc.tamu.edu), made with The
GIMP. Its use is permitted provided Larry Ewing and The GIMP are attributed.

Vectorized by Simon Budig, whose README accompanies this file as
README.budig, as its copyright notice requires.

Redrawn in Inkscape by Garrett LeSage and refined by IFo Hancroft, released
into the public domain (CC0): https://github.com/garrett/Tux
